# ts_cache_crossfade on the mono source: stretched C5 (+12), struck again 2,048 frames in while the first strike's
# sample cache is part-written. The second strike reads the cache and crossfades out of it, through the stretcher's
# buffer, as a mono source.
4608 90 48 64
6656 90 48 64
80000 80 48 40
